;━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
; 5C飛び道具(通常) 移動中
;━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

[Statedef 223]
type=A
movetype=A
physics=N
ctrl=0
anim=222
sprpriority=7

[State ];透過適応用のお守り
type = trans
trigger1 =root,var(34)=0
trans=add
ignorehitpause=1

[State ];発生保障削除フラグ
type = varadd
trigger1 = !(root,var(35)&8)
trigger1 = root,movetype=H
trigger1 = (root,stateno!=[120,159])
var(0)=1

[State ];影を消す
type = AssertSpecial
trigger1 = 1
flag = noshadow
ignorehitpause = 1

[State ];無敵
type = nothitby
trigger1 = 1
value = ,AA,AT
time = 9999
ignorehitpause=1

[State ];相殺用
type = hitoverride
trigger1 = 1
attr = SCA,AA,AP,AT
stateno = 225
time = 9999
ignorehitpause=1

;--------------------[変数処理1]

[State カウンターヒット判定]
type=Varset
trigger1=!movecontact
var(25)=(p2movetype=A)*(!numtarget(220))
ignorehitpause=0

[State 角度決定]
type=varset
trigger1=!time
var(1) = (random**(random%3+1))%41-20

[State ずらす]
type=posadd
trigger1=!time
y=-floor(var(1)*0.5)

[State 直線移動判定1]
type=varset
trigger1=!time
trigger1=abs(var(1))>=15
var(2)=ifelse(var(1)>=1,1,-1)

[State 直線移動判定2]
type=varset
trigger1=var(1)=0
trigger1=abs(var(2))=1
var(2)=var(2)*2

[State 角度を正す]
type=Varadd
trigger1=time
trigger1=var(1)!=0
trigger1=var(2)=[-1,1]
var(1) = ifelse(var(1)>0,-1,1)

[State 角度を正す]
type=Varadd
trigger1=time%2
trigger1=var(2)!=[-1,1]
var(1) = ifelse(var(2)>0,-1,1)

;--------------------[動作]

[State 速度]
type     = velset
trigger1 = 1
x = (9+time*0.2)*cos(var(1)*1.0/(180*1.0/pi))
y = -(9+time*0.2)*sin(var(1)*1.0/(180*1.0/pi))

[State ブレーキ]
type     = velset
trigger1 = movecontact
x = 0
y = 0
ignorehitpause=1

[State 大きさと回転]
type     = angledraw
trigger1 = 1
value = var(1)
scale = (1*root,fvar(32)),(0.75*root,fvar(33))
ignorehitpause=1

;--------------------[音声]

[State 223, 発射音]
type     = PlaySnd
trigger1 = !time
value    = s110, 1
persistent=0

;--------------------[ヒット定義]

[State ];判定削除1
type = attackdist
trigger1 = var(0)
value = 0

[State ];判定削除2
type = statetypeset
trigger1 = var(0)
movetype = I

[State ];判定削除3
type = reversaldef
trigger1 = var(0)
persistent          = 1
reversal.attr       = 
pausetime           = 0,0

[State 223, HitDef];レベルB 400ダメージ 復帰不能25
type                = HitDef
fall.yvelocity      = (-3.5+(enemynear,pos y)*0.010)*(root,var(19)=0)
triggerall          = !movecontact&&!movereversed&&roundstate=2&&!var(0)
trigger1            = ishelper(221)
trigger2            = ishelper(223)
givepower           = floor(400*0.027),floor(400*0.008)
getpower = 30,15
attr                = A, NP
hitflag             = MAFD
guardflag           = MA
damage              = ceil(400*root,fvar(6)*ifelse(var(25)=1,1.25,1)/24),ceil(400*root,fvar(6)/root,fvar(7)/240)
animtype            = midium
ground.type         = Low
priority            = 4, hit
pausetime           = 0, 5
sparkno             = -1
sparkxy             = 0, 0
guard.sparkno       = -1
hitsound            = s1006, 0
guardsound          = s1004, 0
ground.slidetime    = 15
ground.hittime      = 15
guard.slidetime     = 15
guard.ctrltime      = 15
airguard.ctrltime   = 17

ground.velocity     = -6
guard.velocity      = -6
air.velocity        = ifelse((root,var(19)=0),-1.5,-4),ifelse((root,var(19)=0),-7,-1.2)
airguard.velocity   = -5,-4
down.velocity       = -4,-1.2
air.fall            = 1
fall.recovertime    = 25*ifelse(var(25)>=1,2,1)+4
yaccel              = 0.48
guard.kill          = (root,var(35)&128)
Ground.CornerPush.VelOff   = 0
Air.CornerPush.VelOff      = 0
Down.CornerPush.VelOff     = 0
Guard.CornerPush.VelOff    = 0
id = 220

[State 223, HitDef];レベルB 400ダメージ 復帰不能25
type                = HitDef
fall.yvelocity      = (-3.5+(enemynear,pos y)*0.010)*(root,var(19)=0)
triggerall          = !movecontact&&!movereversed&&roundstate=2&&!var(0)
trigger1            = ishelper(220)
trigger2            = ishelper(222)
trigger3            = ishelper(224)
givepower           = floor(400*0.027),floor(400*0.008)
getpower = 30,15
attr                = A, NP
hitflag             = MAFD
guardflag           = MA
damage              = ceil(400*root,fvar(6)*ifelse(var(25)=1,1.25,1)/24),ceil(400*root,fvar(6)/root,fvar(7)/240)
animtype            = midium
ground.type         = high
priority            = 4, hit
pausetime           = 0, 4+ishelper(224)
sparkno             = -1
sparkxy             = 0, 0
guard.sparkno       = -1
hitsound            = s1006, 0
guardsound          = s1004, 0
ground.slidetime    = 15
ground.hittime      = 15
guard.slidetime     = 15
guard.ctrltime      = 15
airguard.ctrltime   = 17

ground.velocity     = -6
guard.velocity      = -6
air.velocity        = ifelse((root,var(19)=0),-1.5,-4),ifelse((root,var(19)=0),-7,-1.2)
airguard.velocity   = -5,-4
down.velocity       = -4,-1.2
air.fall            = 1
fall.recovertime    = 25*ifelse(var(25)>=1,2,1)+4
yaccel              = 0.48
guard.kill          = (root,var(35)&128)
Ground.CornerPush.VelOff   = 0
Air.CornerPush.VelOff      = 0
Down.CornerPush.VelOff     = 0
Guard.CornerPush.VelOff    = 0
id = 220

[State ゲージ回収]
type=poweradd
trigger1=movecontact
value = ifelse(movehit,floor(400*0.09),floor(400*0.041))
persistent=0
ignorehitpause=1

;--------------------[変数処理2]

[State ]
type=parentVarset
triggerall=root,var(25)=0&&movehit=1
trigger1=numtarget(220)
var(13)=1
ignorehitpause=1
persistent=3

[State ]
type=parentVarset
triggerall=var(25)=1&&root,var(13)=0&&movehit=1
trigger1=numtarget(220)
var(13)=2
ignorehitpause=1
persistent=3

[State ダメージ補正]
type=parentVarset
triggerall=movehit=1
trigger1=numtarget(220)
fvar(7)=root,fvar(7)*ifelse((root,fvar(7)<1),ifelse(var(25)=1,0.975,0.95),ifelse(var(25)=1,0.9,0.8))
ignorehitpause=1
persistent=3

[State 初段判定削除]
type=parentVaradd
triggerall=movehit=1
trigger1=numtarget(220)
var(30)=1
ignorehitpause=1
persistent=3

[State ラヴゲージ上昇]
type=parentVaradd
trigger1=movecontact=1&&root,var(46)=0
var(50)=ifelse(movehit>=1,2,1)
persistent=3
ignorehitpause=1

;--------------------[エフェクト]

[State 軌跡エフェクト]
